ent-WeaponLaserSvalinn = 斯瓦林恩雷射手槍 | svalinn laser pistol
    .desc = 一款價格低廉且廣泛使用的雷射手槍。 | A cheap and widely used laser pistol.
ent-WeaponLaserGun = 復古雷射槍 | retro laser blaster
    .desc = 一種利用受激輻射放大光線的武器。 | A weapon using light amplified by the stimulated emission of radiation.
ent-WeaponMakeshiftLaser = 臨時拼湊的雷射手槍 | makeshift laser pistol
    .desc = 最好祈禱它別把你的手燒掉才好。 | Better pray it won't burn your hands off.
ent-WeaponTeslaGun = 特斯拉槍 | tesla gun
    .desc = 你手中蘊含著原始雷電元素的力量。 | The power of the primordial element of lightning in your hands.
ent-WeaponLaserCarbine = 雷射卡賓槍 | laser carbine
    .desc = 因價格低廉且易於使用，而受到 Nanotrasen Security 的青睞。 | Favoured by Nanotrasen Security for being cheap and easy to use.
ent-WeaponLaserCarbinePractice = 練習用雷射卡賓槍 | practice laser carbine
    .desc = 這把經過改裝的雷射卡賓槍會發射功率約為 40 瓦、幾乎無害的光束，用於靶場射擊練習。 | This modified laser carbine fires nearly harmless beams in the 40-watt range, for target practice.
ent-WeaponPulsePistol = 脈衝手槍 | pulse pistol
    .desc = 一款最先進的能量手槍，是北境特工們最青睞的配槍。 | A state of the art energy pistol favoured as a sidearm by the NT operatives.
ent-WeaponPulseCarbine = 脈衝卡賓槍 | pulse carbine
    .desc = 一款深受 NT-ERT 特工青睞的高科技能量卡賓槍。 | A high tech energy carbine favoured by the NT-ERT operatives.
ent-WeaponPulseRifle = 脈衝步槍 | pulse rifle
    .desc = 這是一件名聲幾乎與其使用者同樣惡名昭彰的武器。 | A weapon that is almost as infamous as its users.
ent-WeaponLaserCannon = 雷射砲 | laser cannon
    .desc = 一款重型、高功率的雷射武器。 | A heavy duty, high powered laser weapon.
ent-WeaponParticleDecelerator = 便攜式粒子減速器 | portable particle decelerator
    .desc = 一種便攜式粒子減速器，能夠分解特斯拉或奇點。 | A portable particle decelerator capable of decomposing a tesla or singularity.
ent-WeaponXrayCannon = X光砲 | x-ray cannon
    .desc = 一種利用高強度X射線能量攻擊目標的實驗性武器。 | An experimental weapon that uses concentrated x-ray energy against its target.
ent-WeaponDisablerPractice = 練習禁用器 | practice disabler
    .desc = 一種能耗盡有機目標體能的自衛武器，使其逐漸虛弱直至倒下。這把武器已針對學員進行了調低威力，因此基本上無害。 | A self-defense weapon that exhausts organic targets, weakening them until they collapse. This one has been undertuned for cadets making it mostly harmless.
ent-WeaponDisabler = 停用器 | disabler
    .desc = 一種能耗盡有機目標體力的自衛武器，使其逐漸虛弱直至倒下。 | A self-defense weapon that exhausts organic targets, weakening them until they collapse.
ent-WeaponDisablerSMG = 「禁用者」衝鋒槍 | disabler SMG
    .desc = 一種能耗盡有機目標體力的先進武器，使其逐漸虛弱直至崩潰。 | Advanced weapon that exhausts organic targets, weakening them until they collapse.
ent-WeaponTaser = 電擊槍 | taser
    .desc = 一種低容量、以能量為基礎的電擊槍，由安保團隊用於在近距離制服目標。 | A low-capacity, energy-based stun gun used by security teams to subdue targets at close range.
ent-WeaponTaserSuper = 精英電擊槍 | elite taser
    .desc = 一款低容量、以能量為動力的電擊槍，由精銳安保團隊使用，甚至能讓最頑強的目標失去行動能力。 | A low-capacity, energy-based stun gun used by elite security teams to disable even the toughest of targets.
    .suffix = ADMEME
ent-WeaponAntiqueLaser = 古董雷射手槍 | antique laser pistol
    .desc = 這是一把古董雷射手槍。所有工藝皆屬頂級品質。槍柄採用桃花心木製成，並飾有鍍鉻花絲紋飾。這件物品會射出能量尖刺，散發出威脅感。物品上刻有一名船長與一名小丑的圖案。小丑已死，船長則擺出英姿颯爽的姿勢。 | This is an antique laser pistol. All craftsmanship is of the highest quality. It is decorated with a mahogany grip and chrome filigree. The object menaces with spikes of energy. On the item is an image of a captain and a clown. The clown is dead. The captain is striking a heroic pose.
ent-WeaponAdvancedLaser = 先進雷射手槍 | advanced laser pistol
    .desc = 一款配備自充電核電池的實驗性高能雷射手槍。 | An experimental high-energy laser pistol with a self-charging nuclear battery.
ent-WeaponPistolCHIMP = C.H.I.M.P. 手銃 | C.H.I.M.P. handcannon
    .desc = 只因為它是隻小「C.H.I.M.P.」，不代表它就無法像「A.P.E.」那樣出拳。 | Just because it's a little C.H.I.M.P. doesn't mean it can't punch like an A.P.E.
ent-WeaponPistolCHIMPUpgraded = { ent-WeaponPistolCHIMP }
    .desc = { ent-WeaponPistolCHIMP.desc }
    .suffix = Syndicate
ent-WeaponBehonkerLaser = 巨獸之眼 | eye of a behonker
    .desc = 這是「貝洪克」的眼睛，一捏就會射出雷射。 | The eye of a behonker, it fires a laser when squeezed.
ent-WeaponEnergyShotgun = 能量霰彈槍 | energy shotgun
    .desc = 一款獨一無二的能源武器原型，採用多種霰彈槍配置。它既能發射致命子彈，也能發射非致命子彈，因此是一款用途廣泛的武器。 | A one-of-a-kind prototype energy weapon that uses various shotgun configurations. It offers the possibility of both lethal and non-lethal shots, making it a versatile weapon.
ent-WeaponEnergyMagnum = 能量馬格南 | energy magnum
    .desc = 一款專為精英安保人員設計的高威力自充電能手槍。它具備三種射擊模式，可選擇造成高傷害、穿透窗戶，或進行非致命制伏。 | A high powered self-charging energy pistol designed for elite security personnel. It has has three firing modes allowing for either high damage, window piercing, or non-lethal disabling.
ent-WeaponTemperatureGun = 測溫槍 | temperature gun
    .desc = 一種能射出可改變體溫光束的先進武器。這恐怕已構成某種戰爭罪行。 | An advanced gun that shoots body-temperature-changing beams. This probably constitutes as some kind of war crime.
ent-WeaponLaserGunXenoborg = 外星博格雷射槍 | xenoborg laser gun
    .desc = { ent-WeaponAdvancedLaser.desc }
ent-WeaponLaserCannonXenoborg = 外星機器人雷射砲 | xenoborg laser cannon
    .desc = { ent-WeaponLaserCannon.desc }
ent-WeaponBurstFireLaserXenoborg = 外星博格連發激光 | xenoborg burst fire laser
    .desc = 一種外星武器，透過棱鏡發射連發雷射，使目標瞬間燃起烈火。 | An alien weapon, channelling a burst-fire laser through a prism, causing targets to burst into fire.
ent-WeaponRangeFinderXenoborg = xenoborg 測距儀 | xenoborg range finder
    .desc = { ent-BaseWeaponBatteryNoAmmoCounter.desc }
